# fizzbuzz.ds - Print FizzBuzz from 1 to 100.
#
# Architecture:
#   1. INCLUDE the init macro, which sets up tape state.
#   2. Position pointer at C_LOOPCNT (cell 15).
#   3. PARK (loop while C_LOOPCNT > 0):
#        Move back to c0, INCLUDE the body (one iteration), move to C_LOOPCNT,
#        decrement C_LOOPCNT.
#   4. DRIVE.
#   5. Move pointer back to c0.
#
# The DriveScript INCLUDE mechanism inlines file contents at the include site
# and skips duplicate inclusions. We INCLUDE the body inside the loop body once,
# which is exactly what we want.

INCLUDE "fizzbuzz_init.ds"

# Now ptr at c0. Move to C_LOOPCNT (cell 15) and start the loop.
GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT
PARK
    GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT       # back to c0 for the body

    INCLUDE "fizzbuzz_body.ds"

    GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT    # back to C_LOOPCNT
    BRAKE                                      # decrement loop counter
DRIVE

GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT           # return to c0 for cleanliness
